msgid "The TDHF and TDKS programs"
msgstr "TDHF 与 TDKS 程序"

msgid ""
"The total propagation time (in au) is set by *t*; *dt* sets the timestep and"
" *ns* the number of steps, where two of the three have to be provided. *ng* "
"sets the number of grid points in one dimension (default = 0) and *grsize* "
"the grid size in bohr (default = 10 bohr). Setting *ng* :math:`>2` switches "
"on the calculation of quantum currents (see below). The option *print* "
"determines the level of output (0=normal output, 1=object linear in "
"matrices, 2=matrices as well, :math:`>2` debug). The subcommand ``PULSE`` "
"determines the envelope used, and takes several options depending on the "
"envelope selected. Possibilities are:"
msgstr ""
"总传播时间（以原子单位计）由 *t* 设置；\\ *dt* 设置时间步长，\\ *ns* 设置步数，这三个参数中必须提供两个。\\ *ng* "
"设置一维中的网格点数量（默认值 = 0），\\ *grsize* 设置以玻尔为单位的网格大小（默认值 = 10 玻尔）。将 *ng* 设置为 "
":math:`>2` 会开启量子电流的计算（见下文）。选项 *print* 决定输出级别（0=正常输出，1=矩阵线性对象，2=同时输出矩阵，\\ "
":math:`>2` 为调试模式）。子命令 ``PULSE`` 确定所使用的包络，并根据所选包络接受多个选项。可能的选项有："

msgid ""
"All runs produce a file *($input).dat* (or *molpro.dat*) which contains "
"time-dependent properties, like the components of the field, components of "
"the dipole moment, total energy, orbital occupation numbers, orbital "
"energies and total number of electrons. The Molpro output file specifies the"
" order of the data in the file. For very long runs the size of the file is "
"restricted by printing only every twentieth set of data."
msgstr ""
"所有运行都会生成一个文件 *($input).dat*\\ （或 *molpro.dat*\\ "
"），其中包含随时间变化的性质，例如场的分量、偶极矩的分量、总能量、轨道占据数、轨道能量和总电子数。Molpro "
"输出文件指定了文件中数据的顺序。对于非常长的运行，文件大小受到限制，仅打印每二十组数据。"

msgid ""
"Quantum currents will be calculated when choosing :math:`ng>2`. A cubic grid"
" will be computed of size *grsize* with a total of :math:`ng^3` gridpoints. "
"The imaginary part of the density will be summed at every timestep and after"
" the dynamics the total current will be evaluated at every gridpoint. The "
"user can extract the required data from this array by printing out parts of "
"it, or by integrating over point, but this requires actual coding, as this "
"has not been implemented sufficiently neat. It is also straightforward to "
"evaluate the currents at every timestep or at selected timesteps. This is "
"not done automatically, because it slows down the dynamics considerably."
msgstr ""
"当选择 :math:`ng>2` 时，将计算量子电流。将计算一个大小为 *grsize* 的立方网格，总共有 :math:`ng^3` "
"个格点。在每个时间步对密度的虚部进行求和，并在动力学计算完成后在每个格点评估总电流。用户可以通过打印部分数组或对点进行积分来提取所需数据，但这需要实际编码，因为此功能尚未实现得足够简洁。在每个时间步或选定的时间步评估电流也很直接。这不会自动完成，因为它会显著减慢动力学计算速度。"

msgid ""
"Real-time electronic dynamics using time-dependent Hartree-Fock and time-"
"dependent Kohn-Sham theories can be performed using the commands ``TDHF`` "
"and ``TDKS`` respectively, which have to be preceded by a ``HF`` and ``KS`` "
"command. Unrestricted versions are available through ``TDUHF`` and ``TDUKS``"
" and should be preceded by ``UHF`` and ``UKS`` runs respectively. All "
"methods require symmetry to be switched off. For details on the theory and "
"methods see H. Eshuis, G. G. Balint-Kurti and F. R. Manby, *J. Chem. Phys.* "
":math:`\\mathbf{128}`, 114113 (2008), and references therein. The commands "
"take several options:"
msgstr ""
"使用含时 Hartree-Fock 和含时 Kohn-Sham 理论的实时电子动力学可分别通过 ``TDHF`` 和 ``TDKS`` "
"命令执行，且这两个命令之前必须分别有 ``HF`` 和 ``KS`` 命令。非限制版本可通过 ``TDUHF`` 和 ``TDUKS`` "
"使用，并且应分别在此前运行 ``UHF`` 和 ``UKS``\\ 。所有方法均要求关闭对称性。关于理论和方法细节，参见 H. Eshuis, G. "
"G. Balint-Kurti and F. R. Manby, *J. Chem. Phys.* :math:`\\mathbf{128}`, "
"114113 (2008) 及其中的参考文献。这些命令接受若干选项："

msgid "``NONE: no pulse, no options``"
msgstr "``NONE: no pulse, no options``"

msgid ""
"``STEP, e_x, e_y, e_z, length\\\\`` a DC-field of strength :math:`e_q` is "
"applied in the :math:`q`\\ th direction for a total time *length* (in au)"
msgstr ""
"``STEP, e_x, e_y, e_z, length\\\\`` 在 :math:`q`\\ 方向上施加强度为 :math:`e_q` "
"的直流场，总时间为 *length*\\ （原子单位）"

msgid ""
"``DC, e_x, e_y, e_z, \\alpha\\\\`` a DC-field of strength :math:`e_q` is "
"applied in the :math:`q`\\ th direction. The field is switched on "
"exponentially with a rate determined by :math:`\\alpha`."
msgstr ""
"``DC, e_x, e_y, e_z, \\alpha\\\\`` 在 :math:`q`\\ 方向上施加强度为 :math:`e_q` "
"的直流场。场以由 :math:`\\alpha` 确定的速率指数式开启。"

msgid ""
"``TRAP, e_x, e_y, e_z, \\omega, \\alpha\\\\`` an oscillating field of "
"strength :math:`e_q` is applied in the :math:`q`\\ th direction. The field "
"oscillates with angular frequency :math:`\\omega`. The envelope reaches "
":math:`e_q` in one period of the field, stays constant for :math:`\\alpha` "
"periods and then decays to zero in one period."
msgstr ""
"``TRAP, e_x, e_y, e_z, \\omega, \\alpha\\\\`` 在 :math:`q`\\ 方向上施加强度为 "
":math:`e_q` 的振荡场。场以角频率 :math:`\\omega` 振荡。包络在场地的一个周期内达到 :math:`e_q`\\ ，在 "
":math:`\\alpha` 个周期内保持恒定，然后在下一个周期内衰减至零。"

msgid ""
"``CW, e_x, e_y, e_z, \\omega\\\\`` an oscillating field of strength "
":math:`e_q` is applied in the :math:`q`\\ th direction. The field oscillates"
" with angular frequency :math:`\\omega`. No envelope present."
msgstr ""
"``CW, e_x, e_y, e_z, \\omega\\\\`` 在 :math:`q`\\ 方向上施加强度为 :math:`e_q` "
"的振荡场。场以角频率 :math:`\\omega` 振荡。无包络。"

msgid ""
"``CWSIN, e_x, e_y, e_z, \\omega, \\alpha\\\\`` an oscillating field of "
"strength :math:`e_q` is applied in the :math:`q`\\ th direction. The field "
"oscillates with angular frequency :math:`\\omega` and is switched on using a"
" :math:`\\sin^2` envelope, where :math:`\\alpha` determines how fast the "
"field is switched on."
msgstr ""
"``CWSIN, e_x, e_y, e_z, \\omega, \\alpha\\\\`` 在 :math:`q`\\ 方向上施加强度为 "
":math:`e_q` 的振荡场。场以角频率 :math:`\\omega` 振荡，并使用 :math:`\\sin^2` 包络开启，其中 "
":math:`\\alpha` 决定场开启的速度。"

msgid ""
"``CWGAUSS, e_x, e_y, e_z, \\omega, \\alpha\\\\`` like ``CWSIN``, but with a "
"Gaussian envelope"
msgstr ""
"``CWGAUSS, e_x, e_y, e_z, \\omega, \\alpha\\\\`` 类似 ``CWSIN``\\ ，但使用 "
"Gaussian 包络"

msgid ""
"``TDKS`` and ``TDUKS`` use the options provided by the ``KS`` and ``UKS`` "
"commands. At the moment ``TDKS``/``TDUKS`` suffers from numerical "
"instabilities when using strong fields. Divergence of the energy is "
"observed, possibly due to the use of quadrature for the evaluation of the "
"potential."
msgstr ""
"``TDKS`` 和 ``TDUKS`` 使用 ``KS`` 和 ``UKS`` 命令提供的选项。目前，\\ ``TDKS``/``TDUKS`` "
"在使用强场时会出现数值不稳定性。观察到能量发散，这可能是由于使用求积来计算势。"
